13. verify documentation;
14. verify the AI register/declaration requirements.

AI POLICY

This implementation is AI-assisted.

Follow the repository’s AI policy and COMS3011A AI policy exactly.

Update the appropriate AI register/documentation if required.

Any code-generation commit for this work must include:

Assisted-by: Codex[GPT-5.6 Sol]

Do not commit until all repository-required checks and AI attribution requirements have been satisfied.

COMPLETION RESPONSE

